# Music Library

A full stack web app for managing artists, albums and songs. Built with Node.js, Express and SQLite on the backend, and plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript on the frontend.

## How to run it

```bash
cd backend
npm install
node server.js
```

Then open `frontend/index.html` in your browser.

## What it does

- Add, edit and delete artists, albums and songs
- Data is stored in a SQLite database and persists on restart
- Deleting an artist automatically deletes their albums and songs

## Tech used

- Node.js + Express — backend API
- SQLite (sql.js) — database
- HTML, CSS, JavaScript — frontend
